# Scratch browser checks. 16 of these reached main on 2026-09-25 across eight
# PRs because `git add -A` swept them up — one-off Playwright probes with a
# personal job directory hard-coded in them. A check worth keeping belongs in
# `scripts/audit/*.mjs` under a real name, the way the navigation-contract pass
# was folded into `responsive.mjs`; a leading underscore means "not that".
